        "eyebrow": "The basics",
        "heading": "What a waterproof sock is",
        "lead_first_para": true,
        "prose": "<p>A waterproof sock looks like an ordinary sock and has a thin waterproof layer sealed between two knitted layers. The knit gives it the fit and feel of a sock. The layer in the middle stops water reaching your foot, while still letting sweat escape as vapour.</p><p>Worn inside a boot or a shoe, it keeps your feet dry at the point your footwear can’t any more — four hours into a wet walk, or on the ride home in shoes that never dried out.</p>",
        "lede": ""
      }
    },
