            "heading": "The waterproof layer",
            "role": "The waterproof barrier",
            "body": "<p>A Porelle® membrane. Water can’t get through it. Water vapour, which is far smaller, can. That is the entire principle, and it has been used in outdoor clothing since the 1970s.</p>",
            "tint": "#eaf5ff"
          }
        },
        "m3": {
