          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the waterproof layer named?",
            "body": "<p>An unnamed “waterproof laminate” is a claim with nobody behind it. A named one is made by a company that has to stand behind it. Ours is Porelle®.</p>"
          }
        },
        "c2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How many layers, and does it say?",
            "body": "<p>Three is the standard build: lining, waterproof layer, outer knit. If a listing doesn’t say, it’s usually because the answer is two.</p>"
          }
        },
